      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Sends Phlebo Booking Guide on WhatsApp\nGuides phlebotomists on how to create bookings in the Engagement Console.\nAlways attaches: SuperShyft_Booking_Guide.pdf\nExpects: { notification_id, engagement_id?, members: [{ first_name, phone }] }",
